        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-518 (ensure controlled execution — Lease Booking, Billing &amp; Asset Lifecycle Management (PA-96.2).) | - operational: voluntary-surrender negotiation and legal process
Owner: Lease Credit Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
